                <div class="account-my-cases__membership-tier-{{ section.id }}">PAID</div>
                <h3 class="account-my-cases__membership-name-{{ section.id }}">Priority Review</h3>
                <p class="account-my-cases__membership-copy-{{ section.id }}">
                  Future upgrade path for faster moderation visibility, deeper case insights, and enhanced member support.
                </p>
                <div class="account-my-cases__membership-foot-{{ section.id }}">Coming soon</div>
              </article>
              <article class="account-my-cases__membership-card-{{ section.id }}">
                <div class="account-my-cases__membership-tier-{{ section.id }}">SUPER</div>
                <h3 class="account-my-cases__membership-name-{{ section.id }}">Full Command Tier</h3>
                <p class="account-my-cases__membership-copy-{{ section.id }}">
                  Future premium tier for advanced family or investigator workflows when the broader member system is expanded.
                </p>
                <div class="account-my-cases__membership-foot-{{ section.id }}">Locked for future release</div>
              </article>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="account-my-cases__section-{{ section.id }}" id="member-portal-visibility-{{ section.id }}">
            <div class="account-my-cases__section-head-{{ section.id }}">
              <div>
                <p class="account-my-cases__eyebrow-{{ section.id }}">Boost + Spotlight</p>
                <h2 class="account-my-cases__section-title-{{ section.id }}">Visibility Upgrades</h2>
              </div>
              <p class="account-my-cases__section-copy-{{ section.id }}">
                Existing boost and spotlight purchase flows stay on live case pages. This portal explains the options without rewriting those working systems.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="account-my-cases__request-grid-{{ section.id }}">
              <article class="account-my-cases__request-card-{{ section.id }}">
                <div class="account-my-cases__request-status-{{ section.id }}">Boost case</div>
                <h3 class="account-my-cases__request-title-{{ section.id }}">Increase Visibility</h3>
